<div class="chapter-row reveal"><div class="chapter"><span>01</span> THE PRODUCT</div><div><h3>From first tap to saved file.</h3><p>The interface groups the product into a simple journey: welcome and onboarding, link entry, format selection, download status, completion feedback, saved media, additional tools and settings.</p></div></div>
