<div class="section-head reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">04 / Data model &amp; ER diagram</div><h2>Every task has<br><em>a traceable record.</em></h2></div><p>This illustrative data model shows how users, media metadata, download jobs, preferences and subscription status could be organised if the app persists those records.</p></div>
