<div class="section-head reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">06 / Feature map</div><h2>Small utilities.<br><em>Connected journeys.</em></h2></div><p>The features below are based on the supplied SaveIt interface concept. Confirm which are implemented and which are roadmap ideas before publishing claims.</p></div>
<div class="feature-grid">
<article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="index">01</span><span class="feature-icon">↧</span><h3>Link-based download</h3><p>A focused link input and clear action to start the supported download workflow.</p><small>START HERE</small></article>
<article class="feature-card reveal delay-1"><span class="index">02</span><span class="feature-icon">▤</span><h3>Quality selection</h3><p>Compare resolution, format and approximate file size before choosing an option.</p><small>CHOOSE FORMAT</small></article>
<article class="feature-card reveal delay-2"><span class="index">03</span><span class="feature-icon">◷</span><h3>Download manager</h3><p>Track progress and speed, review queued tasks and cancel an active job where supported.</p><small>TRACK PROGRESS</small></article>
<article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="index">04</span><span class="feature-icon">✓</span><h3>Completion feedback</h3><p>Show a clear success state with a direct path to the saved file.</p><small>FINISH WITH CLARITY</small></article>
<article class="feature-card reveal delay-1"><span class="index">05</span><span class="feature-icon">▣</span><h3>Saved library</h3><p>Organise downloaded media into video, photo and audio categories.</p><small>FIND IT AGAIN</small></article>
<article class="feature-card reveal delay-2"><span class="index">06</span><span class="feature-icon">✳</span><h3>Platform shortcuts</h3><p>Present familiar source-platform entry points without making the home screen crowded.</p><small>QUICK ACCESS</small></article>
<article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="index">07</span><span class="feature-icon">⚙</span><h3>Personal settings</h3><p>Configure default quality, save location, notifications, theme and language.</p><small>MAKE IT YOURS</small></article>
<article class="feature-card reveal delay-1"><span class="index">08</span><span class="feature-icon">♛</span><h3>Pro subscription concept</h3><p>Communicate premium options and plan pricing transparently, if monetisation is enabled.</p><small>OPTIONAL UPGRADE</small></article>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section workflow"><div class="container">
<div class="section-head reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">07 / Example user flow</div><h2>From shared link<br>to <em>saved media.</em></h2></div><p>A clear flow gives the user confidence and gives the engineering team a concrete path to test.</p></div>
<div class="flow-track reveal"><div class="flow-step"><small>STEP 01</small><b>Paste a link</b><p>Validate the link and source.</p></div><span class="flow-arrow">→</span><div class="flow-step"><small>STEP 02</small><b>Read metadata</b><p>Retrieve available media details.</p></div><span class="flow-arrow">→</span><div class="flow-step"><small>STEP 03</small><b>Choose quality</b><p>Select format and resolution.</p></div><span class="flow-arrow">→</span><div class="flow-step"><small>STEP 04</small><b>Save &amp; review</b><p>Track the task and open the file.</p></div></div>
</div></section>

